# AI Agent Rules

AI material matching is not implemented in the current codebase.

Rules:
- Read docs/08-implementation-status.md before starting AI work.
- Read docs/features/ai-agent.md and docs/flows/ai-material-matching-flow.md.
- Treat ai_requests, ai_material_matches, ai_credit_wallets, and ai_usage_logs as not implemented unless schema/docs change.
- Do not describe AI material matching, AI credits, admin portal, moderator portal, delivery workflow, or learner reservation creation as implemented.
- Keep price-suggestion AI separate from the product AI material-matching agent.
- Update docs when AI behavior, credit rules, logs, API behavior, schema, or flow changes.
- If unsure whether docs are needed, ask explicitly.
